[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:93. Our New Neighbour]
[00:00.800]Lesson 93 | 第93课
[00:03.330]Mr. Hill is our new next-door neighbour. | 希尔先生是我们的新邻居。
[00:07.575]He's a BEA pilot. | 他是英国欧洲航空公司的飞行员。
[00:11.100]He was in the RAF during the war. | 战争期间，他曾在皇家空军服役。
[00:15.935]He will fly to New York next month. | 下个月他将飞往纽约。
[00:20.545]The month after next, he will fly to Tokyo. | 下下个月他将飞往东京。
[00:25.725]At the moment, he's in Madrid. | 眼下他正在马德里。
[00:29.450]He flew to Spain a week ago. | 一星期前他飞往西班牙。
[00:33.385]He will return to London the week after next. | 他将于下下周返回伦敦。
[00:39.200]He's only 41 years old | 他才41岁
[00:42.910]and he has already been to nearly every country in the world. | 就几乎走遍了世界上的每一个国家。
[00:48.150]Mr. Hill is a very lucky man. | 希尔先生是个非常幸运的人。
[00:52.015]But his wife isn't very lucky. | 但他的妻子就不那么幸运了。
[00:54.950]She usually stays at home. | 她通常待在家里。